  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845860,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Step into the high-octane world of espionage as James Bond in *007 Racing* for PlayStation! Developed by Eutechnyx and based on the iconic James Bond film franchise, this racing game puts you behind the wheel of legendary vehicles like the Aston Martin DB5, Lotus Esprit, and BMW Z8, each equipped with Q-Branch’s signature gadgets and weaponry.\n\nThe storyline unfolds as Bond investigates a plot by a European diplomat and businessman to smuggle NATO weapons to terrorists. Your mission takes you across the globe, from the bustling streets of New York City to the exotic landscapes of Mexico and the Baltic Sea, encountering familiar faces like Jack Wade and Xenia Onatopp along the way. \n\nExperience a blend of racing and mission-based gameplay, thwarting the villain’s plans through thrilling chases and gadget-fueled challenges. While Tim Bentinck provides Bond’s voice, the inimitable John Cleese returns as Q, delivering essential intel and equipment. *007 Racing* offers both single-player and multiplayer modes, providing hours of Bond-themed action and adventure."
    },
